Verification Strategy
After each phase, run this evaluation protocol:

Train new model bundle: python scripts/train_models.py --version <phase_name>
Backtest deterministic predictions: Run evaluate.py backtest on 2024 H2 held-out data
Track: Precision@3, @5, @10, Spearman, MAE (total + per-split)
Backtest simulation: For each backtest race, run MC simulation and compare:
Calibration: % of actual finishes within sim [p10, p90] interval
Rank calibration: % of actual ranks within rank [p10, p90] interval
Pack accuracy: compare predicted front-pack membership to actual (from wtcs_pack_membership)
Regression check: Ensure deterministic model accuracy doesn't degrade when simulation changes